* SETEXIT FACE 2 -- AN ARMED TRAP TAKES CONTROL WHEN A RUNTIME ERROR OCCURS.
* The divisor is held in a VARIABLE on purpose: SPITBOL constant-folds 1/0 at COMPILE
* time, which is diagnosed before SETEXIT can ever arm, so a literal witness measures
* the folder and not the trap.
	SETEXIT(.H)
	&ERRLIMIT = 10
	D = 0
	X = 1 / D
	OUTPUT = "AFTER"
	:(END)
H	OUTPUT = "HANDLER " &ERRTEXT " S" &LASTNO
	:(END)
END
